- **src/fares.ts** (`fareFor`): Line 10 uses strict greater-than (>) which excludes age 65, contradicting the spec comment on line 7 that states 'Riders aged 65 AND OVER'. Changing to >= produces the correct boundary where riders aged exactly 65 receive the concession fare.  <== **THIS CHANGE PRODUCES THE VALUE** — it is what makes the new or corrected data exist. Without it, every other change here only moves a value that never changed. [runs: both]
  - **Minimal fix:** Change line 10 comparison operator from > to >= so that riders aged 65 enter the concession fare branch

